   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Tinha» + participle",
     "texto": [
      "To talk about something that happened before another past action, use **tinha** (had) + participle: **Disse-me que tinha ido ao médico** (he told me he had gone to the doctor).",
      "Same as the compound perfect, but with **tinha** instead of **tenho**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Already",
     "texto": [
      "With **já** (already): **já tinha feito** (had already done). The **já** goes before the auxiliary verb."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
